<report>
<line><title>Two independent proportions</title></line>
<line>Total 1 = <in>n_1</in>,  response 1 = <in>r_1</in></line>
<line>Proportion 1 = <in>prop_1</in></line>
<line>Total 2 = <in>n_2</in>,  response 2 = <in>r_2</in></line>
<line>Proportion 2 = <in>prop_2</in></line>
<line></line>
<line>Proportion difference = <in>prop_diff</in></line>
<line></line>
<line><ci>Approximate (Miettinen) <in>ci</in>% confidence interval = <in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci></line>
<block name="exact2">
<line></line>
<line><pval>Exact two sided (mid) <in>mp</in></pval></line>
</block>
<line></line>
